%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e813a894a35754d77b6414fccd3fdd7c, type: 3}
  m_Name: Therapist Archetype
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ProgressionArchetypeSO
  archetypeName: Leslie
  angerThresholdToBlock: 8
  dialogueSpreadsheet: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 4bebc036ee653e24b9207ed4edec3f4b, type: 3}
  conversationSequence:
  - npcLineVariations:
    - Your profile picture gives off major avoidant attachment style energy. I need
      someone who can hold space for me.
    - I'm sensing a deeply disorganized attachment from your bio. Are you currently
      doing the work to heal your inner child?
    - Just based on how you text, I can tell you have an insecure-avoidant attachment.
      I only date securely attached men.
    options:
    - answerText: I don't know what that means.
      angerValue: 1
    - answerText: You're projecting your own insecurities onto a stranger.
      angerValue: 2
    - answerText: My attachment style is 'out of your league'.
      angerValue: 3
    - answerText: My inner child thinks your inner child is a loser.
      angerValue: 4
  - npcLineVariations:
    - I need to set a boundary right now. You aren't matching my emotional labor
      and it's highly triggering.
    - I'm establishing a firm boundary. I will not carry the mental load for this
      conversation while you give nothing.
    - Your lack of communication is crossing a boundary. I require active emotional
      labor from my partners.
    options:
    - answerText: Sounds like a lot of work.
      angerValue: 1
    - answerText: You're being overly sensitive about a dating app chat.
      angerValue: 2
    - answerText: I'm not reading all that, congratulations or sorry that happened.
      angerValue: 3
    - answerText: I'm billing you $200 an hour for reading these messages.
      angerValue: 4
  - npcLineVariations:
    - Stop trying to gaslight me! You are completely invalidating my lived experience
      right now.
    - The way you're speaking to me is textbook gaslighting. My lived experience
      is valid, regardless of your opinion.
    - Are you gaslighting me right now? Because it feels like you're actively dismissing
      my emotional reality.
    options:
    - answerText: I literally didn't say anything.
      angerValue: 1
    - answerText: Gaslighting isn't real, you made that up because you're crazy.
      angerValue: 2
    - answerText: Your lived experience sounds incredibly boring.
      angerValue: 3
    - answerText: I'm not gaslighting you, I'm gatekeeping and girlbossing you.
      angerValue: 4
  - npcLineVariations:
    - Your toxic behavior is activating my trauma response. I am actively being triggered
      by your words.
    - You are triggering a severe trauma response in my body. I need you to take
      accountability for your impact.
    - My fight-or-flight is activated. Your aggressive communication style is a massive
      trigger for my past trauma.
    options:
    - answerText: Just take a deep breath.
      angerValue: 1
    - answerText: You're responsible for your own triggers, don't blame me.
      angerValue: 2
    - answerText: Good, I hope it ruins your whole week.
      angerValue: 3
    - answerText: 'Trigger warning: I''m about to call you ugly.'
      angerValue: 4
  - npcLineVariations:
    - You are displaying severe narcissistic tendencies. You literally lack the capacity
      for cognitive empathy.
    - It's giving covert narcissist. You center yourself in every interaction and
      have zero emotional intelligence.
    - I am dealing with a textbook malignant narcissist. You are completely devoid
      of basic human empathy.
    options:
    - answerText: Okay, whatever you say.
      angerValue: 1
    - answerText: You just call everyone you don't like a narcissist.
      angerValue: 2
    - answerText: I'm a narcissist because I'm actually better than you.
      angerValue: 3
    - answerText: I have plenty of empathy, I just don't want to waste it on a mid-tier
        match.
      angerValue: 4
  - npcLineVariations:
    - My nervous system is completely dysregulated right now because of your toxic
      energy.
    - You have pushed me out of my window of tolerance. My nervous system is in a
      state of absolute dysregulation.
    - I am physically shaking. Your refusal to do the work has completely dysregulated
      my somatic baseline.
    options:
    - answerText: Maybe drink some water.
      angerValue: 1
    - answerText: You're acting hysterical over absolutely nothing.
      angerValue: 2
    - answerText: Go take a Xanax and leave me alone.
      angerValue: 3
    - answerText: Have you tried turning your nervous system off and on again?
      angerValue: 4
  - npcLineVariations:
    - Don't you dare use toxic positivity on me! You are deflecting from doing the
      shadow work!
    - This is classic deflection. You refuse to integrate your shadow self and resort
      to toxic positivity instead.
    - Stop avoiding the root wound! Your toxic positivity is just a defense mechanism
      to avoid real vulnerability!
    options:
    - answerText: I'm just chilling.
      angerValue: 1
    - answerText: You're the one deflecting from the fact that you're unhinged.
      angerValue: 2
    - answerText: My shadow self thinks you're an insufferable loser too.
      angerValue: 3
    - answerText: "Good vibes only! \u2728 Live Laugh Love! \u2728"
      angerValue: 4
